// Klinika AI Voice Agent + navbat tizimi — ma'lumotlar bazasi sxemasi
// Barcha vaqtlar bazada UTC da saqlanadi, ko'rsatishda Asia/Tashkent ga o'giriladi.

generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client-js"
}

datasource db {
  provider = "postgresql"
  url      = env("DATABASE_URL")
}

// ───────────────────────── ENUMS ─────────────────────────

enum Source {
  TELEGRAM
  VOICE
  ADMIN
}

enum AppointmentStatus {
  PENDING
  CONFIRMED
  CHECKED_IN
  COMPLETED
  CANCELLED
  NO_SHOW
}

enum VisitType {
  FIRST
  FOLLOW_UP
}

enum CalendarStatus {
  OPEN
  CLOSED
}

enum CancelledBy {
  PATIENT
  ADMIN
  DOCTOR
  SYSTEM
}

enum Gender {
  MALE
  FEMALE
}

enum Language {
  UZ
  RU
}

enum ServiceCategory {
  CONSULTATION
  DIAGNOSTICS
  LABORATORY
  PROCEDURE
  MINOR_SURGERY
  TREATMENT_COURSE
  VACCINATION
  DENTISTRY
}

enum RoomType {
  CONSULTATION
  ULTRASOUND
  ECG
  PROCEDURE
  LABORATORY
  XRAY
  OPERATING
  DENTAL
}

enum CallOutcome {
  BOOKED
  NOT_BOOKED
  ESCALATED
  DROPPED
  EMERGENCY
  RESCHEDULED
  CANCELLED
  INFO_ONLY
}

enum ExceptionType {
  DAY_OFF
  VACATION
  HOLIDAY
  EXTRA_WORKING_DAY
}

enum WaitlistStatus {
  WAITING
  OFFERED
  BOOKED
  CANCELLED
  EXPIRED
}

enum AdminRole {
  SUPERADMIN
  ADMIN
  DOCTOR
}

enum CourseStatus {
  ACTIVE
  COMPLETED
  CANCELLED
}

enum Relation {
  SELF
  CHILD
  SPOUSE
  PARENT
  OTHER
}

// ───────────────────────── MODELS ─────────────────────────

model Patient {
  id                Int       @id @default(autoincrement())
  telegramId        String?   @unique
  firstName         String
  lastName          String?
  phone             String    @unique // har doim +998XXXXXXXXX ko'rinishida
  birthDate         DateTime?
  gender            Gender?
  medicalCardNumber String    @unique

  // Oila profillari: bola yoki qarindosh profili kattaga bog'lanadi
  guardianId         Int?
  guardian           Patient?  @relation("FamilyMembers", fields: [guardianId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)
  familyMembers      Patient[] @relation("FamilyMembers")
  relationToGuardian Relation  @default(SELF)

  source   Source   @default(TELEGRAM)
  language Language @default(UZ)

  // Nozik xizmat nomlari xabarlarda yozilmasin
  discreetMode         Boolean   @default(true)
  notificationsConsent Boolean   @default(true)
  recordingConsent     Boolean   @default(false)
  recordingConsentAt   DateTime?

  noShowCount     Int     @default(0)
  isBlacklisted   Boolean @default(false)
  blacklistReason String?
  adminNote       String?

  appointments    Appointment[]
  waitlistEntries Waitlist[]
  courses         TreatmentCourse[]
  reviews         Review[]

  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  @@index([phone])
  @@index([guardianId])
}

model Specialty {
  id             Int      @id @default(autoincrement())
  nameUz         String
  nameRu         String
  descriptionUz  String?
  descriptionRu  String?
  icon           String?
  // Shikoyat/so'z sinonimlari — marshrutlash lug'ati (tashxis EMAS)
  symptomAliases String[] @default([])
  sortOrder      Int      @default(0)
  isActive       Boolean  @default(true)

  doctors         Doctor[]
  services        Service[]
  waitlistEntries Waitlist[]

  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt
}

model Doctor {
  id          Int       @id @default(autoincrement())
  firstName   String
  lastName    String
  photoUrl    String?
  specialtyId Int
  specialty   Specialty @relation(fields: [specialtyId], references: [id])

  category        String? // oliy toifa, t.f.n. va h.k.
  experienceYears Int      @default(0)
  licenseNumber   String?
  bioUz           String?
  bioRu           String?
  gender          Gender
  minAge          Int      @default(0)
  maxAge          Int      @default(120)
  languages       String[] @default(["uz", "ru"])

  phone      String?
  telegramId String?

  firstVisitPrice Int @default(0) // so'mda
  followUpPrice   Int @default(0)

  isActive             Boolean        @default(true)
  calendarStatus       CalendarStatus @default(OPEN)
  calendarClosedReason String?

  workingHours    WorkingHour[]
  exceptions      ScheduleException[]
  appointments    Appointment[]
  services        Service[]           @relation("DoctorServices")
  waitlistEntries Waitlist[]
  courses         TreatmentCourse[]
  adminUsers      AdminUser[]

  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  @@index([specialtyId])
}

model Service {
  id            Int      @id @default(autoincrement())
  photoUrl      String?
  nameUz        String
  nameRu        String
  descriptionUz String?
  descriptionRu String?
  // Xalq tilidagi nomlar: "UZI", "analiz", "kardiogramma" ...
  aliases       String[] @default([])

  oldPrice        Int?
  price           Int
  category        ServiceCategory @default(CONSULTATION)
  durationMinutes Int             @default(30)

  specialtyId Int
  specialty   Specialty @relation(fields: [specialtyId], references: [id])
  doctors     Doctor[]  @relation("DoctorServices")

  requiredRoomType RoomType?
  minAge           Int       @default(0)
  maxAge           Int       @default(120)

  preparationUz     String?
  preparationRu     String?
  prepReminderHours Int     @default(24)

  // true bo'lsa xizmat nomi avtomatik xabarlarga yozilmaydi
  isSensitive Boolean @default(false)

  isCourse            Boolean @default(false)
  sessionCount        Int     @default(1)
  sessionIntervalDays Int     @default(1)

  isActive Boolean @default(true)

  appointments    Appointment[]
  waitlistEntries Waitlist[]
  courses         TreatmentCourse[]

  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  @@index([specialtyId])
}

model Room {
  id           Int           @id @default(autoincrement())
  name         String
  type         RoomType      @default(CONSULTATION)
  isActive     Boolean       @default(true)
  appointments Appointment[]

  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt
}

model Appointment {
  id Int @id @default(autoincrement())

  patientId Int
  patient   Patient @relation(fields: [patientId], references: [id])
  doctorId  Int
  doctor    Doctor  @relation(fields: [doctorId], references: [id])
  serviceId Int
  service   Service @relation(fields: [serviceId], references: [id])
  roomId    Int?
  room      Room?   @relation(fields: [roomId], references: [id])

  startTime DateTime // UTC
  endTime   DateTime // UTC
  visitType VisitType @default(FIRST)
  price     Int       @default(0)

  status        AppointmentStatus @default(CONFIRMED)
  source        Source            @default(TELEGRAM)
  bookedByPhone String? // ota-ona bola uchun yozdirganda

  onTheWay   Boolean   @default(false)
  onTheWayAt DateTime?

  // Har bir eslatma bir martadan yuborilishi uchun
  dayBeforeReminderSentAt  DateTime?
  hourBeforeReminderSentAt DateTime?
  prepInstructionSentAt    DateTime?
  feedbackRequestedAt      DateTime?
  patientConfirmedAt       DateTime?

  courseId      Int?
  course        TreatmentCourse? @relation(fields: [courseId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)
  sessionNumber Int?

  cancelledBy  CancelledBy?
  cancelReason String?
  cancelledAt  DateTime?

  patientNote    String? // tibbiy ma'lumot emas
  idempotencyKey String? @unique

  callLog CallLog?
  review  Review?

  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  // Ikki marta band qilishning oldini olish (DB darajasida)
  @@unique([doctorId, startTime], name: "doctor_slot")
  @@unique([roomId, startTime], name: "room_slot")
  @@index([startTime])
  @@index([patientId])
  @@index([status])
}

model WorkingHour {
  id         Int     @id @default(autoincrement())
  doctorId   Int
  doctor     Doctor  @relation(fields: [doctorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  dayOfWeek  Int // 1 = dushanba ... 7 = yakshanba (ISO)
  startTime  String // "09:00" (Toshkent vaqti)
  endTime    String // "17:00"
  breakStart String? // "13:00"
  breakEnd   String? // "14:00"
  isWorking  Boolean @default(true)
  shift      String? // "morning" | "evening"

  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  @@index([doctorId, dayOfWeek])
}

model ScheduleException {
  id        Int           @id @default(autoincrement())
  doctorId  Int
  doctor    Doctor        @relation(fields: [doctorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  date      DateTime // sana (kun boshi, Toshkent bo'yicha)
  type      ExceptionType @default(DAY_OFF)
  startTime String? // EXTRA_WORKING_DAY uchun
  endTime   String?
  note      String?

  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  @@unique([doctorId, date])
  @@index([date])
}

model Waitlist {
  id          Int        @id @default(autoincrement())
  patientId   Int
  patient     Patient    @relation(fields: [patientId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  serviceId   Int?
  service     Service?   @relation(fields: [serviceId], references: [id])
  specialtyId Int?
  specialty   Specialty? @relation(fields: [specialtyId], references: [id])
  doctorId    Int?
  doctor      Doctor?    @relation(fields: [doctorId], references: [id])

  dateFrom           DateTime
  dateTo             DateTime
  preferredPartOfDay String? // "morning" | "afternoon" | "any"

  status         WaitlistStatus @default(WAITING)
  offeredSlot    DateTime?
  offerExpiresAt DateTime?

  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  @@index([status])
}

model TreatmentCourse {
  id        Int     @id @default(autoincrement())
  patientId Int
  patient   Patient @relation(fields: [patientId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  doctorId  Int
  doctor    Doctor  @relation(fields: [doctorId], references: [id])
  serviceId Int
  service   Service @relation(fields: [serviceId], references: [id])

  sessionCount Int
  intervalDays Int          @default(1)
  startDate    DateTime
  status       CourseStatus @default(ACTIVE)

  appointments Appointment[]

  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt
}

model CallLog {
  id          Int       @id @default(autoincrement())
  callSid     String?   @unique
  phone       String // maskalangan holda ham saqlanadi
  startedAt   DateTime  @default(now())
  endedAt     DateTime?
  durationSec Int?

  outcome            CallOutcome @default(DROPPED)
  transcript         String?     @db.Text
  detectedLanguage   Language?
  misunderstandCount Int         @default(0)
  avgLatencyMs       Int?

  appointmentId Int?         @unique
  appointment   Appointment? @relation(fields: [appointmentId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)

  recordingUrl String?
  deleteAfter  DateTime?

  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  @@index([startedAt])
  @@index([outcome])
}

model Review {
  id            Int         @id @default(autoincrement())
  appointmentId Int         @unique
  appointment   Appointment @relation(fields: [appointmentId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  patientId     Int
  patient       Patient     @relation(fields: [patientId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  rating        Int // 1..5
  comment       String?
  isPublished   Boolean     @default(false)

  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
}

model AdminUser {
  id           Int       @id @default(autoincrement())
  login        String    @unique
  passwordHash String
  fullName     String
  role         AdminRole @default(ADMIN)
  doctorId     Int?
  doctor       Doctor?   @relation(fields: [doctorId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)
  isActive     Boolean   @default(true)
  lastLoginAt  DateTime?

  auditLogs AuditLog[]

  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt
}

model AuditLog {
  id          Int        @id @default(autoincrement())
  adminUserId Int?
  adminUser   AdminUser? @relation(fields: [adminUserId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)
  action      String // CREATE | UPDATE | DELETE | VIEW | LOGIN
  entity      String // "Patient", "Appointment", ...
  entityId    String?
  oldValue    Json?
  newValue    Json?
  ip          String?
  createdAt   DateTime   @default(now())

  @@index([entity, entityId])
  @@index([createdAt])
}

model SiteSetting {
  id               Int     @id @default(1)
  clinicName       String  @default("Klinika")
  phone            String  @default("")
  address          String  @default("")
  landmark         String?
  latitude         Float?
  longitude        Float?
  socialLink       String?
  logoUrl          String?
  licenseNumber    String?
  workingHoursText String  @default("Dush-Shan 08:00-18:00")

  cancellationWindowMinutes Int     @default(120)
  minLeadTimeMinutes        Int     @default(30)
  appointmentBufferMinutes  Int     @default(5)
  noShowThreshold           Int     @default(3)
  recordingRetentionDays    Int     @default(90)
  discreetModeDefault       Boolean @default(true)
  emergencyPhone            String  @default("103")
  operatorPhone             String?

  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt
}

model CallbackRequest {
  id        Int       @id @default(autoincrement())
  phone     String
  reason    String?
  note      String?
  isHandled Boolean   @default(false)
  handledAt DateTime?
  createdAt DateTime  @default(now())

  @@index([isHandled])
}
